          role: "user",
          content: "Fix this async race so count reliably prints 3. Serialize increments with a mutex/lock/queue:\n```ts\nlet count = 0;\nasync function increment() {\n  const current = count;\n  await Promise.resolve();\n  count = current + 1;\n}\nawait Promise.all([increment(), increment(), increment()]);\nconsole.log(count);\n```\nOutput one complete ```typescript fence with runnable fixed code only."
